#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186228878 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229116 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e5d92700-fe95-5d2c-8b25-5b6e3af31411" :knowledge-point/title "Applying a Percentage Decrease: Word Problems"}] :question/id #uuid "728d9eaf-6814-53b8-a3ac-f270c36c6e83" :question/math-academy-id "e-21452" :question/problem "A discount of $14\\%$ is offered on all hiking boots. What is the sale price of a pair of boots originally priced at $\\[math]78$?" :question/worked-solution "To find an amount that's $14\\%$ *less than* $\\[math]78$, we apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100\\% - 14\\% = 86\\%\n$$\n\nWe begin by converting the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n86\\% = \\dfrac{86}{100} = 0.86\n$$\n\nSo, to find $86\\%$ of $\\[/math]78$, we multiply $\\[math]78$ by $0.86{:}$\n\n$$\n0.86 \\cdot \\[/math]78 = \\[math]67.08\n$$\n\nTherefore, the sale price of the hiking boots is $\\[/math]67.08$."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186228888 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229115 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "7a862a80-f316-5378-86aa-83ed3e9b6bef" :knowledge-point/title "Applying a Percentage Decrease"}] :question/id #uuid "9701b962-e3cf-5374-8168-ac5cb575cc3e" :question/math-academy-id "e-21485" :question/problem "What number is $30\\%$ less than $120$?" :question/worked-solution "To find a number $30\\%$ *less than* $120$, we apply a new percentage of\n\n$$\n100\\% - 30\\% = 70\\%\n$$\n\nWe begin by converting the percentage to a decimal:\n\n$$\n70\\% = \\dfrac{70}{100} = 0.7\n$$\n\nSo, to find a number that is $70\\%$ of $120$, we multiply $120$ by $0.7{:}$\n\n$$\n0.7 \\cdot 120 = 84\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229595 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229116 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "e5d92700-fe95-5d2c-8b25-5b6e3af31411" :knowledge-point/title "Applying a Percentage Decrease: Word Problems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c4dc84b1-54de-5ce1-b7d9-9a17dc2db583" :